# Uploaded issue photos are runtime data, not source. Note the path:
# a pattern containing a slash is anchored to this file's directory, so
# a bare "uploads/*" here never matched backend/uploads/ at all - which
# is why those files kept showing up as untracked.
backend/uploads/*
!backend/uploads/.gitkeep

